{
  "_comment": [
    "Full set of nine events. MEASURED COST (2026-08-14): each hook",
    "invocation is a PowerShell process spawn costing ~478 ms under",
    "powershell.exe and ~600 ms under pwsh. PreToolUse and PostToolUse fire on",
    "every single tool call, so registering both adds ~956 ms per tool call -",
    "roughly 19 s on a twenty-tool turn. Delete those two blocks unless you",
    "specifically want per-tool colour detail. The other seven fire a handful",
    "of times per turn and cost about 1 s per turn regardless of workload.",
    "C:/code/zt/.claude/settings.json holds the trimmed seven-event set.",
    "Registering project-scoped and pointing at the repo copy of the script",
    "avoids staging it in C:/tools and makes edits take effect immediately."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "powershell.exe",
            "args": [
              "-NoProfile",
              "-ExecutionPolicy",
              "Bypass",
              "-File",
              "C:/tools/claude-zj-hook.ps1"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "powershell.exe",
            "args": [
              "-NoProfile",
              "-ExecutionPolicy",
              "Bypass",
